    "terrainName": "berlin",
    "description": "What: Simulated devices SD-S1 (§5a, R6-4 / R-4300). A scripted trainee possesses the Observer (a laser rangefinder in his kit), binds his view to it and aims at a marker 450 m away; then the run PAUSES for 120 frames (do: pause - sim time held, the frames go on) and inside the pause he opens the menu (paused frame 10) and ranges the marker (paused frame 40). Judge: (1) the device answers in pause: the menu is open at paused frame 20 and the range is measured (450 m within 3 m) at paused frame 80 - as a PREVIEW (a spot traced in pause, which no consumer acts on); (2) the HUD shows the range with its PREVIEW tag; (3) the world does not move: every paused frame is sampled, and no unit moves and no shot is fired. Fail: the device waits for time to advance, or anything in the world changes in the pause. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh dv-paused-operation"
  },
